			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1795280929350,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "1³ + … + k³ + (k+1)³ = (k(k+1)/2)² + (k+1)³        <- inductive\n   hypothesis used here\n    = (k+1)² [ k²/4 + (k+1) ]\n    = (k+1)² (k² + 4k + 4)/4\n    = (k+1)² (k+2)²/4\n    = ((k+1)(k+2)/2)²   ✓\nSo P(k+1) is true.",
			"originalText": "1³ + … + k³ + (k+1)³ = (k(k+1)/2)² + (k+1)³        <- inductive\n   hypothesis used here\n    = (k+1)² [ k²/4 + (k+1) ]\n    = (k+1)² (k² + 4k + 4)/4\n    = (k+1)² (k+2)²/4\n    = ((k+1)(k+2)/2)²   ✓\nSo P(k+1) is true.",
			"fontSize": 18,
			"fontFamily": 1,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
