			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1795280929350,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "P(1) is true (basis), and P(k) → P(k+1) for every k ≥ 1\n   (inductive step).\nBy mathematical induction, P(n) is true for all positive integers\n   n.",
			"originalText": "P(1) is true (basis), and P(k) → P(k+1) for every k ≥ 1\n   (inductive step).\nBy mathematical induction, P(n) is true for all positive integers\n   n.",
