			"updated": 1795280929350,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Basis n = 0:  LHS = 3,  RHS = 3(5¹ − 1)/4 = 3  ✓\nIH:  assume 3 + 3·5 + … + 3·5ᵏ = 3(5ᵏ⁺¹ − 1)/4  for some k ≥ 0.\nStep: add 3·5ᵏ⁺¹ to both sides (IH used):\n3(5ᵏ⁺¹ − 1)/4 + 3·5ᵏ⁺¹ = 3(5ᵏ⁺¹ − 1 + 4·5ᵏ⁺¹)/4\n    = 3(5·5ᵏ⁺¹ − 1)/4\n    = 3(5ᵏ⁺² − 1)/4  ✓",
			"originalText": "Basis n = 0:  LHS = 3,  RHS = 3(5¹ − 1)/4 = 3  ✓\nIH:  assume 3 + 3·5 + … + 3·5ᵏ = 3(5ᵏ⁺¹ − 1)/4  for some k ≥ 0.\nStep: add 3·5ᵏ⁺¹ to both sides (IH used):\n3(5ᵏ⁺¹ − 1)/4 + 3·5ᵏ⁺¹ = 3(5ᵏ⁺¹ − 1 + 4·5ᵏ⁺¹)/4\n    = 3(5·5ᵏ⁺¹ − 1)/4\n    = 3(5ᵏ⁺² − 1)/4  ✓",
			"fontSize": 18,
			"fontFamily": 1,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
