			"updated": 1795280929350,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Basis n = 1:  LHS = 1,  RHS = 1·2·3·5/30 = 1  ✓\nIH:  assume ∑(j=1 to k) j⁴ = k(k+1)(2k+1)(3k²+3k−1)/30  for some\n   k ≥ 1.\nStep: add (k+1)⁴ (IH used):\nsum = (k+1) [ k(2k+1)(3k²+3k−1) + 30(k+1)³ ] / 30\nk(2k+1)(3k²+3k−1) = 6k⁴ + 9k³ + k² − k\n30(k+1)³ = 30k³ + 90k² + 90k + 30\nbracket = 6k⁴ + 39k³ + 91k² + 89k + 30\nTarget: (k+2)(2k+3)(3(k+1)²+3(k+1)−1) = (2k²+7k+6)(3k²+9k+5)\n    = 6k⁴ + 39k³ + 91k² + 89k + 30   ✓ equal\nSo P(k+1) is true.",
			"originalText": "Basis n = 1:  LHS = 1,  RHS = 1·2·3·5/30 = 1  ✓\nIH:  assume ∑(j=1 to k) j⁴ = k(k+1)(2k+1)(3k²+3k−1)/30  for some\n   k ≥ 1.\nStep: add (k+1)⁴ (IH used):\nsum = (k+1) [ k(2k+1)(3k²+3k−1) + 30(k+1)³ ] / 30\nk(2k+1)(3k²+3k−1) = 6k⁴ + 9k³ + k² − k\n30(k+1)³ = 30k³ + 90k² + 90k + 30\nbracket = 6k⁴ + 39k³ + 91k² + 89k + 30\nTarget: (k+2)(2k+3)(3(k+1)²+3(k+1)−1) = (2k²+7k+6)(3k²+9k+5)\n    = 6k⁴ + 39k³ + 91k² + 89k + 30   ✓ equal\nSo P(k+1) is true.",
			"fontSize": 18,
			"fontFamily": 1,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
