			"updated": 1795280929350,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "LHS = 1 + 1/4 = 5/4.     RHS = 2 − 1/2 = 3/2 = 6/4.\nSince 5/4 < 6/4, P(2) is true.  ✓",
			"originalText": "LHS = 1 + 1/4 = 5/4.     RHS = 2 − 1/2 = 3/2 = 6/4.\nSince 5/4 < 6/4, P(2) is true.  ✓",
