		{
			"type": "text",
			"id": "e37",
			"x": 20,
			"y": 2548.8095683199995,
			"width": 660,
			"height": 157.5,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"strokeWidth": 1,
			"strokeStyle": "solid",
			"roughness": 0,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 527971459,
			"version": 3,
			"versionNonce": 510126034,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1795280929350,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Basis n = 1:  11² + 12¹ = 121 + 12 = 133,  and 133 | 133  ✓\nIH:  assume 133 | 11ᵏ⁺¹ + 12²ᵏ⁻¹  for some k ≥ 1.\nStep: 11ᵏ⁺² + 12²ᵏ⁺¹ = 11·11ᵏ⁺¹ + 144·12²ᵏ⁻¹\n    = 11(11ᵏ⁺¹ + 12²ᵏ⁻¹) + 133·12²ᵏ⁻¹\nThe first term is divisible by 133 (IH), the second has factor\n   133.\nSo 133 | 11ᵏ⁺² + 12²ᵏ⁺¹  ✓",
			"originalText": "Basis n = 1:  11² + 12¹ = 121 + 12 = 133,  and 133 | 133  ✓\nIH:  assume 133 | 11ᵏ⁺¹ + 12²ᵏ⁻¹  for some k ≥ 1.\nStep: 11ᵏ⁺² + 12²ᵏ⁺¹ = 11·11ᵏ⁺¹ + 144·12²ᵏ⁻¹\n    = 11(11ᵏ⁺¹ + 12²ᵏ⁻¹) + 133·12²ᵏ⁻¹\nThe first term is divisible by 133 (IH), the second has factor\n   133.\nSo 133 | 11ᵏ⁺² + 12²ᵏ⁺¹  ✓",
			"fontSize": 18,
			"fontFamily": 1,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
