		{
			"type": "text",
			"id": "e49",
			"x": 820,
			"y": 642.7802679199998,
			"width": 660,
			"height": 112.5,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"strokeWidth": 1,
			"strokeStyle": "solid",
			"roughness": 0,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 985327207,
			"version": 3,
			"versionNonce": 1153458770,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1795280929350,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Let k ≥ 10. Then k+1 ≥ 11, so k − 2 ≥ 8.\nBy the IH, P(k−2) is true: k−2 cents can be formed with 3¢ and 5¢\n   stamps.\nAdd one 3¢ stamp: this gives (k−2) + 3 = k+1 cents.\nSo P(k+1) is true.  ✓",
			"originalText": "Let k ≥ 10. Then k+1 ≥ 11, so k − 2 ≥ 8.\nBy the IH, P(k−2) is true: k−2 cents can be formed with 3¢ and 5¢\n   stamps.\nAdd one 3¢ stamp: this gives (k−2) + 3 = k+1 cents.\nSo P(k+1) is true.  ✓",
			"fontSize": 18,
			"fontFamily": 1,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"autoResize": true,
			"index": "b08h",
			"created": null,
			"hasTextLink": false,
			"rawText": "",
			"labelPosition": null,
			"baseFontSize": null
		},
