			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1795280929350,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Formable: 0, 4, 8, 11, 12, 15, 16, 19, 20, 22, 23, 24, 26, 27, 28\n   and every n ≥ 30.\nNot formable: 1, 2, 3, 5, 6, 7, 9, 10, 13, 14, 17, 18, 21, 25,\n   29.\n(checked directly: 4a + 11b)\nClaim: every n ≥ 30 can be formed.",
			"originalText": "Formable: 0, 4, 8, 11, 12, 15, 16, 19, 20, 22, 23, 24, 26, 27, 28\n   and every n ≥ 30.\nNot formable: 1, 2, 3, 5, 6, 7, 9, 10, 13, 14, 17, 18, 21, 25,\n   29.\n(checked directly: 4a + 11b)\nClaim: every n ≥ 30 can be formed.",
			"fontSize": 18,
