		{
			"type": "text",
			"id": "e61",
			"x": 820,
			"y": 1685.7809358399998,
			"width": 660,
			"height": 157.5,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"strokeWidth": 1,
			"strokeStyle": "solid",
			"roughness": 0,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 289904397,
			"version": 3,
			"versionNonce": 1176173778,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1795280929350,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Basis: 30 = 4·2 + 11·2,  31 = 11·1 + 4·5,  32 = 4·8,  33 = 11·3.\nIH:  assume P(j) is true for ALL j with 30 ≤ j ≤ k, where k ≥ 33.\nStep: k+1 ≥ 34, so k+1−4 = k−3 ≥ 30. By IH, k−3 can be formed;\nadd one 4¢ stamp to get k+1.  ✓\nDifference: in (b) the IH assumes only P(k). In (c) the IH\n   assumes\nP(j) for every j from 30 up to k.",
			"originalText": "Basis: 30 = 4·2 + 11·2,  31 = 11·1 + 4·5,  32 = 4·8,  33 = 11·3.\nIH:  assume P(j) is true for ALL j with 30 ≤ j ≤ k, where k ≥ 33.\nStep: k+1 ≥ 34, so k+1−4 = k−3 ≥ 30. By IH, k−3 can be formed;\nadd one 4¢ stamp to get k+1.  ✓\nDifference: in (b) the IH assumes only P(k). In (c) the IH\n   assumes\nP(j) for every j from 30 up to k.",
			"fontSize": 18,
			"fontFamily": 1,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"autoResize": true,
			"index": "b08s",
