		{
			"type": "text",
			"id": "e64",
			"x": 820,
			"y": 1994.5432437599995,
			"width": 660,
			"height": 270,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"strokeWidth": 1,
			"strokeStyle": "solid",
			"roughness": 0,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 800098447,
			"version": 3,
			"versionNonce": 1423841166,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1795280929350,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Totals = 25a + 40b (a, b ≥ 0); all are multiples of 5.\nFormable: 0, 25, 40, 50, 65, 75, 80, 90, 100, 105, 115, 120, 125,\n   130\nand every multiple of 5 that is ≥ 140.\nClaim: every multiple of 5 that is ≥ 140 can be formed.\nBasis:  140 = 4·25 + 40,   145 = 25 + 3·40,   150 = 6·25,\n               155 = 3·25 + 2·40,   160 = 4·40.\nIH:  every multiple of 5 from 140 up to k can be formed, k ≥ 160.\nStep: k+5 ≥ 165, so k+5−25 ≥ 140 is a multiple of 5 in the IH\n   range;\nit can be formed. Add one $25 certificate to get k+5.  ✓\n(Other multiples of 5 below 140, e.g. 135, cannot be formed.)",
			"originalText": "Totals = 25a + 40b (a, b ≥ 0); all are multiples of 5.\nFormable: 0, 25, 40, 50, 65, 75, 80, 90, 100, 105, 115, 120, 125,\n   130\nand every multiple of 5 that is ≥ 140.\nClaim: every multiple of 5 that is ≥ 140 can be formed.\nBasis:  140 = 4·25 + 40,   145 = 25 + 3·40,   150 = 6·25,\n               155 = 3·25 + 2·40,   160 = 4·40.\nIH:  every multiple of 5 from 140 up to k can be formed, k ≥ 160.\nStep: k+5 ≥ 165, so k+5−25 ≥ 140 is a multiple of 5 in the IH\n   range;\nit can be formed. Add one $25 certificate to get k+5.  ✓\n(Other multiples of 5 below 140, e.g. 135, cannot be formed.)",
			"fontSize": 18,
			"fontFamily": 1,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
