		{
			"type": "text",
			"id": "e70",
			"x": 820,
			"y": 2814.567859599999,
			"width": 660,
			"height": 315,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"strokeWidth": 1,
			"strokeStyle": "solid",
			"roughness": 0,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 656193100,
			"version": 3,
			"versionNonce": 1441487438,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1795280929350,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Basis: 1 = 2⁰.\nIH:  every integer j with 1 ≤ j ≤ k is a sum of distinct powers\n   of 2.\nStep: consider k+1.\nCase k+1 even:  (k+1)/2 is an integer with 1 ≤ (k+1)/2 ≤ k.\n  By IH, (k+1)/2 = 2^a₁ + … + 2^aₘ (distinct exponents).\n  Multiply by 2:  k+1 = 2^(a₁+1) + … + 2^(aₘ+1), still distinct.\n     ✓\nCase k+1 odd:  k+1 = 2m + 1 with 1 ≤ m ≤ k (as k ≥ 1).\n  By IH, m = 2^a₁ + … + 2^aₘ (distinct), so\n  k+1 = 2⁰ + 2^(a₁+1) + … + 2^(aₘ+1).\n  All other exponents are ≥ 1, so 2⁰ is not repeated: distinct.\n     ✓\nSo every positive integer is a sum of distinct powers of two.",
			"originalText": "Basis: 1 = 2⁰.\nIH:  every integer j with 1 ≤ j ≤ k is a sum of distinct powers\n   of 2.\nStep: consider k+1.\nCase k+1 even:  (k+1)/2 is an integer with 1 ≤ (k+1)/2 ≤ k.\n  By IH, (k+1)/2 = 2^a₁ + … + 2^aₘ (distinct exponents).\n  Multiply by 2:  k+1 = 2^(a₁+1) + … + 2^(aₘ+1), still distinct.\n     ✓\nCase k+1 odd:  k+1 = 2m + 1 with 1 ≤ m ≤ k (as k ≥ 1).\n  By IH, m = 2^a₁ + … + 2^aₘ (distinct), so\n  k+1 = 2⁰ + 2^(a₁+1) + … + 2^(aₘ+1).\n  All other exponents are ≥ 1, so 2⁰ is not repeated: distinct.\n     ✓\nSo every positive integer is a sum of distinct powers of two.",
			"fontSize": 18,
			"fontFamily": 1,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"autoResize": true,
