		{
			"type": "text",
			"id": "e103",
			"x": 1620,
			"y": 2338.8014756799994,
			"width": 660,
			"height": 202.5,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"strokeWidth": 1,
			"strokeStyle": "solid",
			"roughness": 0,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 816837474,
			"version": 2,
			"versionNonce": 51733330,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1795280929346,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "P(n): 5 | a+b for every (a,b) obtained with n applications of the\n   recursive step.\nBasis n = 0:  (0,0), and 5 | 0  ✓\nIH:  P(j) is true for all 0 ≤ j ≤ k.\nStep: a pair obtained with k+1 applications is (a+2, b+3) or\n   (a+3, b+2),\nwhere (a,b) was obtained with k applications. By IH, 5 | a+b.\nNew sum = (a+b) + 5, which is divisible by 5.  ✓\nSo P(k+1) is true; 5 | a+b for all (a,b) ∈ S.",
			"originalText": "P(n): 5 | a+b for every (a,b) obtained with n applications of the\n   recursive step.\nBasis n = 0:  (0,0), and 5 | 0  ✓\nIH:  P(j) is true for all 0 ≤ j ≤ k.\nStep: a pair obtained with k+1 applications is (a+2, b+3) or\n   (a+3, b+2),\nwhere (a,b) was obtained with k applications. By IH, 5 | a+b.\nNew sum = (a+b) + 5, which is divisible by 5.  ✓\nSo P(k+1) is true; 5 | a+b for all (a,b) ∈ S.",
			"fontSize": 18,
			"fontFamily": 1,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"autoResize": true,
			"index": "b0f",
			"created": null,
			"hasTextLink": false,
