			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1795280929346,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Basis: (0,0) ∈ S and 5 | 0 + 0  ✓\nRecursive step: let (a,b) ∈ S with 5 | a+b (IH).\nThe new pairs (a+2, b+3) and (a+3, b+2) both have sum a + b + 5,\nwhich is divisible by 5.  ✓\nBy structural induction, 5 | a+b for all (a,b) ∈ S.",
			"originalText": "Basis: (0,0) ∈ S and 5 | 0 + 0  ✓\nRecursive step: let (a,b) ∈ S with 5 | a+b (IH).\nThe new pairs (a+2, b+3) and (a+3, b+2) both have sum a + b + 5,\nwhich is divisible by 5.  ✓\nBy structural induction, 5 | a+b for all (a,b) ∈ S.",
			"fontSize": 18,
			"fontFamily": 1,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
