			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Basis step:  λ (empty string), 0 and 1 are palindromes.\nRecursive step:  if w is a palindrome, then 0w0 and 1w1 are\n   palindromes.\n(Nothing else is a palindrome.)",
			"originalText": "Basis step:  λ (empty string), 0 and 1 are palindromes.\nRecursive step:  if w is a palindrome, then 0w0 and 1w1 are\n   palindromes.\n(Nothing else is a palindrome.)",
