			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1795280929346,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "n = 2 gives F(2) = 1 + F(−1), and F(−1) is not defined.\nAlso F(3) = 1 + F(0), and F(0) is not defined.\nSo F is not well-defined (not defined at n = 3).",
			"originalText": "n = 2 gives F(2) = 1 + F(−1), and F(−1) is not defined.\nAlso F(3) = 1 + F(0), and F(0) is not defined.\nSo F is not well-defined (not defined at n = 3).",
			"fontSize": 18,
			"fontFamily": 1,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
