			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "n = 3 gives F(3) = 1 + F(3/2), and 3/2 is not an integer,\nso F(3/2) is not defined.\nSo F is not well-defined.",
			"originalText": "n = 3 gives F(3) = 1 + F(3/2), and 3/2 is not an integer,\nso F(3/2) is not defined.\nSo F is not well-defined.",
