			"version": 2,
			"versionNonce": 457799442,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1795280929346,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "1 is odd, so the rule gives F(1) = 1 − F(0). F(0) is not defined,\nand this clashes with the given F(1) = 1.\nSo F is not well-defined.",
			"originalText": "1 is odd, so the rule gives F(1) = 1 − F(0). F(0) is not defined,\nand this clashes with the given F(1) = 1.\nSo F is not well-defined.",
			"fontSize": 18,
