		{
			"type": "text",
			"id": "e124",
			"x": 1620,
			"y": 3943.2898915199994,
			"width": 660,
			"height": 157.5,
			"angle": 0,
			"strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
			"backgroundColor": "transparent",
			"fillStyle": "solid",
			"strokeWidth": 1,
			"strokeStyle": "solid",
			"roughness": 0,
			"opacity": 100,
			"groupIds": [],
			"frameId": null,
			"roundness": null,
			"seed": 92973434,
			"version": 2,
			"versionNonce": 1623992654,
			"isDeleted": false,
			"boundElements": [],
			"updated": 1795280929346,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "F(5) = F(3·5 − 1) = F(14)\n     = 1 + F(7)         (14 is even)\n     = 1 + F(3·7 − 1) = 1 + F(20)\n     = 2 + F(10)\n     = 3 + F(5).\nSo F(5) = 3 + F(5), which is impossible.\nNo value can be assigned to F(5), so F is not well-defined.",
			"originalText": "F(5) = F(3·5 − 1) = F(14)\n     = 1 + F(7)         (14 is even)\n     = 1 + F(3·7 − 1) = 1 + F(20)\n     = 2 + F(10)\n     = 3 + F(5).\nSo F(5) = 3 + F(5), which is impossible.\nNo value can be assigned to F(5), so F is not well-defined.",
			"fontSize": 18,
			"fontFamily": 1,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"lineHeight": 1.25,
			"autoResize": true,
